From 19e48a2991206711da7e2f19763c8439f61b70bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:27:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Every family catchable in Johto, fossil reviver at the Ruins
 of Alph

tools/hack/encounters.py places 130 entries so that every non-legendary
family has a Johto source outside the Safari Zone, weak ones early and
the strongest with seven or eight badges.

tools/hack/fossil_reviver.py copies the Pewter Museum's fossil reviver
into the Ruins of Alph Research Center, built from dumped script, event
and text files. Rock Smash now turns up the Dome Fossil at the Ruins of
Alph and the Skull, Armor and Root Fossils in Cliff Cave.

The Goldenrod shop sells the Shiny Stone only after Chuck's badge.
